WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.460
An AI answer can help.

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.450
But your content still needs a process.

3
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.660
Start with a clear brief.

4
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.770
Let tools help draft,

5
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.230
check, and package the work.

6
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.220
Then review the claims,

7
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.030
fix the voice,

8
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.470
and approve the result.

9
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.160
Chatbots can use tools too—

10
00:00:18.591 --> 00:00:19.346
the difference is how

11
00:00:19.346 --> 00:00:20.460
the workflow is organized,

12
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.280
and how much it handles.

13
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.740
Keep your judgment in the loop.

14
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.330
Build smarter with Neural Vansh.
